'''The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)''' is the 9th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It it was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]] and appears every Sunday. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Volley Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

