==Battleground==
*1 [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*4 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 166.67 seconds<sup>5,000f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 213.33 seconds<sup>6,400f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is of no challenge if attempted with all [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]] from all three [[Cats of the Cosmos]] chapters, as it was implemented before the last two chapters. In case this stage is attempted earlier, just spamming [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellites]] will not be enough.

Just like any other [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]], the boss is best dealt with by units who can slow it down or freeze it consistently, such as [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]]. The only thing to keep an eye on is range, as units like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] cannot hope to reach the Cyclone.

[[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Cats with Warp Immunity]] will fare very well here as they will not be interrupted. However, if they are attacked, they will quickly die as they will not be Warped to a safer distance. One good example is Rover Cat, who acts as a great meatshield against the Cyclone.

If you have [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Miter Saw Cat]], he'll be the only unit you'll need, given his Warp immunity and massive damage, just make sure to bring some research combos so you can spam Miter Saws.

The same can be said if you have [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]]. With 2 small attack up combos, simply spamming them will cause them to be warped continuously after hitting it, killing every peon in its way and eventually Super Cosmic Cyclone.

