==Trivia==
*The Wormhole Opens is the first [[Legend Stages|Legend Stage]] to use a [[Backgrounds|background]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. The background was initially unique to [[Black Hole (Cats of the Cosmos)|Black Hole]].
*In the [https://twitter.com/PONOS_EN/status/939555252562522112 announcement Tweet] for The 2nd Dimension, the English [[PONOS Corporation|PONOS]] Twitter account mistakenly referred to [[Super Cosmic Cyclone]] as "Super Space Cyclone", its Japanese name.
*This stage used to be treated as a limited Deadly stage like [[Realm of Carnage (Deadly)|Realm of Carnage]], since it lasted for 3 days and is a [[No Continues]] stage. In [[Version 6.8 Update|version 6.8]], however, PONOS changed its schedule to every Sunday, making it share the same schedule with [[Attack on Titanium (Insane)|Attack on Titanium]].

